cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the method paper below."
title: "SRO-Config: Generalised configurational analysis of RMCProfile large-box models"
abstract: >-
  A tool for Clapp-style configurational analysis of the large-box atomic models
  produced by RMCProfile. Generalises the method of Clapp (1971) - originally
  limited to binary primitive, FCC or BCC crystals - to crystalline materials of
  any structure with any number of constituent elements.
type: software
